1 REM FBCS FIL-0503
2 REM CLAIM A-11.2.4.1-TR177
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM STD 11.2.4.1 l.7247-7251, 11.2.5 7206, 5.2.4: the RECORD index is rounded first and then compared with one:
5 REM RECORD .7 is record 1, RECORD 1.6 is record 2, RECORD .4 is 0 (7206).
100 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0503.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION RELATIVE, RECTYPE INTERNAL
110 WRITE #1, RECORD 1: 10
120 WRITE #1, RECORD 2: 20
130 READ #1, RECORD .7: A
140 PRINT A
150 READ #1, RECORD 1.6: A
160 PRINT A
170 WHEN EXCEPTION IN
180   READ #1, RECORD .4: A
190   PRINT "NOEXC"
200 USE
210   PRINT EXTYPE
220 END WHEN
230 END
